                    1. Klicka Anslut ovan
                 </span>
                 <span className="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-100 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 border border-slate-200">
                    2. Välj "Breakout Rooms"
                 </span>
                 <span className="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-100 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 border border-slate-200">
                    3. Gå med i ditt rum
                 </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 4. Calendar (Meetings this Sunday) */}
        <div className="space-y-6">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
